lts to ≤12%\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Estimates were age-adjusted to the 2000 U.S. standard population consistent with HP2010 methodology.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sample weights were used to account for the complex sample design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"To improve the precision and reliability of the estimates, CDC combined 7 years of NHIS data collected during 2004--2010.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Estimates by education status were adjusted using four age groups: 18--24, 25--44, 45--64, and ≥65 years.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Estimates suppressed because relative standard error for estimate was >30%.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}